    {
      "name": "no_generalization",
      "kind": "qualification",
      "statement": "Metrics describe only the recorded Sparse BM25 run over the frozen Project-Derived Corpus and Evaluation Query Set; they do not generalize to other corpora, models, chunking policies, or languages."
